#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:15
#: eee5efc5121f4fc4ba1cb4247ab915bd
msgid "Images are geotagged with the vehicle's Latitude, Longitude and Altitude (above sea level) at the moment the photo was taken.  These value can be viewed with any EXIF viewer"
